description.narrative:
Through the project VEI will support MCC developing the knowledge, procedures and skills of its staff in some of the most critical areas listed above. In this respect, MCC considers the following three themes to be the of the highest priority for a short-term intervention:

1. Non-Revenue Water (NRW);

2. Hydraulic modelling and Geographic Information Systems (GIS);

3. Water pressure management.

Training interventions in these areas can help MCC overcome some of the most pressing challenges and result in direct improvements in water supply for the population at large and the sustainability of the operations.
